## 4. Experimental Setup

<!-- SECTION_LEVEL: 3 -->
### 4.1 Datasets

We evaluate our approach on three benchmark datasets:

1. **ImageNet-2023**: Extended version of ImageNet with 1.5M images across 2000 categories
2. **COCO-Multimodal**: Enhanced COCO dataset with additional modalities
3. **MIT-Indoor67**: Indoor scene recognition dataset with RGB-D data

<!-- SECTION_LEVEL: 3 -->
### 4.2 Implementation Details

The EMFN model was implemented using PyTorch 2.0 and trained on NVIDIA A100 GPUs. Training hyperparameters are summarized in Table 1.

| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Learning Rate | 0.001 |
| Batch Size | 64 |
| Optimizer | Adam |
| Weight Decay | 1e-4 |
| Dropout Rate | 0.2 |
| Max Epochs | 200 |

Table 1: Training Hyperparameters {#tbl:hyperparameters}

