### 4.3 Baseline Methods

We compare EMFN against the following baseline methods:

- **ResNet-50** [@He2016]: Standard CNN baseline
- **ViT-Base** [@Dosovitskiy2020]: Vision Transformer baseline  
- **CLIP** [@Radford2021]: Contrastive Language-Image Pre-training
- **MMBT** [@Kiela2019]: Multimodal Bitransformers

